\par\par \b \uc2 INTERVIEW:Baht Peaking, To Ease With Rates '07 -BankThai  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Phisanu Phromchanya  \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES  \par \uc2 607 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Oktober 2006\par 07:06\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Further upside for the baht, which reached a fresh seven-year high on Friday, is limited and it will likely ease next year in line with expected lower local interest rates, according to an executive at BankThai PCL (BT.TH).  \par \par \uc2 "There is not much room for the baht to gain further as it's now very close to peaking...I believe that the baht would find strong resistance at around 36.50 and it shouldn't breach 36.00 level," Sutee Losoponkul, BankThai's executive vice president for Treasury Department, told Dow Jones Newswires in an interview.  \par \par \uc2 He said pent-up dollar demand from importers remains substantial, because they are waiting to see how far the dollar will fall, and weakness in the U.S. unit might encourage some importers and debtors to be more aggressive in building larger positions.  \par \par \uc2 The Bank of Thailand's plan to ease rules on local entities investing overseas will also prevent the baht from rising rapidly, he said.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar hit the fresh seven-year low on Friday night of THB36.65, the lowest since July 1999. It has steadily fallen from THB37.95 on Sept. 19, when a bloodless coup ousted former Prime Minister Thaksin Shinawatra. It has fallen by just over 10% this year from THB41.025.  \par \par \uc2 Thanks to weakening inflationary pressures resulting from lower global oil prices, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to maintain its policy target repo 14-day rate at 5.00% for the remainder of this year to make sure inflation is tamed before starting to cut rates, said Sutee.  \par \par \uc2 "When it becomes clearer that inflation is actually on the downtrend, it will be easier for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to make a rate-cut decision. Interest rates should start falling in the first or second quarter of next year, with a possible cut of around 50 basis points altogether...Lower rates should also pull baht lower," said Sutee.  \par \par \uc2 New Measures To Reduce \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Burden  \par \par \uc2 After using both verbal and actual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the past week in a failed attempt to stop the baht from rallying, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday stepped up its battle to slow the baht's appreciation by saying it was considering relaxing foreign investment rules for local entities.  \par \par \uc2 Acting \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Tarisa Watanagase said Friday that the bank is studying possibilities and there could be relaxation on the amount of investment or the conditions of investment.  \par \par \uc2 "This measure is a good move as it would help slow down the baht's rise while at the same time allowing investment diversification by local funds...Besides, it will help lessen the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  burden on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Sutee.  \par \par \uc2 However, any actual impact will depend on how much the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  relaxes its regulations, he said.  \par \par \uc2 Tarisa said Friday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought the dollar to lift the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the U.S. unit had fallen too far, too fast. The comments were the first public admission of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Tarisa, who was appointed by the Cabinet last week to the post and is awaiting official endorsement by \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's king.  \par \par \uc2 Traders suspect that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times in recent days.  \par \par \uc2 Foreign investors have been active buyers of Thai shares since the middle of this month. Their net purchases have totaled THB18.2 billion so far this month, compared with net purchases of around THB11 billion last month.  \par \par \uc2 -By Phisanu Phromchanya, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744; phisanu.phromchanya@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Graham Norris [ 30-10-06 0606GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020061030e2au000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
