\par\par \b \uc2 Thai Ctrl Bk Chief: Agrees With Fin Min's Baht Target  \b0\par\par\uc2 318 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 August 2006\par 11:14\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Thailand's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  agrees with Finance Minister Thanong Bidaya's target level for the baht, Bank of Thailand Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula said Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 Thanong earlier in the day said the appropriate dollar level for this year is between THB37.50 and THB38.00, while for next year it is around THB37.50.  \par \par \uc2 "If the finance minister said so, we have to believe him. Our view is in line with the finance ministry," Pridiyathorn told reporters. [ 23-08-06 0921GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 At Wednesday's close in Asia, the dollar was quoted at THB37.62, up from THB37.56 at Tuesday's close.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar dropped to a six-and-a-half-year low of THB37.28 on Aug. 11, and was only restrained from setting fresh lows last week by heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Pridiyathorn said the recent rise in \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign reserves was mainly due to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, with the authority buying dollars to help curb the Thai baht's strength.  \par \par \uc2 As of Aug. 11, the country's foreign reserves stood at $59.4 billion with a net forward position of $5 billion.  \par \par \uc2 "Even though we have costs (from market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), this can be offset by returns from our higher foreign reserves," Pridiyathorn said.  \par \par \uc2 Sterilization of the increase in local money supply caused by dollar buying through issuance of baht-denominated bonds raises the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's interest costs, but these costs are offset by interest income on the higher foreign reserves. Dollar weakness against other key \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  has further boosted the foreign reserves in dollar terms, he added.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier said its foreign reserves comprise many key \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It didn't elaborate.  \par \par \uc2 -By Bangkok Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 661 2660744; djnews.bangkok@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Hilary Mc Cully [ 23-08-06 1027GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020060823e28n000f6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
