\par\par \b \uc2 Thai  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  says to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  on baht  \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 August 2006\par 09:06\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes, detail)  \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK, Aug 15 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday to slow a rise of the baht supported by heavy fund inflows on Friday, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Pridiyathorn Devakula said.  \par \par \uc2 "We will enter the market later. My feeling is the baht is a bit too strong and we are looking at it, to try to make it a bit weaker," Pridiyathorn told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 His comments sent the baht down to around 37.45 per dollar after it had hovered mostly around 37.38 in morning trade. But it was back at 37.40 at 0730 GMT.  \par \par \uc2 The baht is the best performing Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year, having appreciated about 10.05 percent against the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 Large foreign fund inflows on Friday into the Thai stock market, the worst performer in Southeast Asia this year, could be attributed to attractive prices, Pridiyathorn said. He denied market speculation that the baht's recent rise was boosted by funds brought in on behalf of GE Capital for a reported purchase of shares in Bank of Ayudhya Pcl estimated to be worth around $300 million.  \par \par \uc2 "We have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier through sporadic actions and we will be a bit more active later although we are going against overall market trend," he said.  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-THAILAND-BAHT (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060815e28f000cu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
