\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Thai Baht Ends Weaker On Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 361 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 August 2006\par 13:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2006, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--The Thai baht retreated Tuesday after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed that it continued to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to curb the baht's strength after it hit a six-and-a-half year high Friday, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 However, the baht's fall was limited by offshore parties' dollar selling and the U.S. unit's generally soft tone against regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in intraday trading, they said.  \par \par \uc2 Government bond prices ended lower, in line with movement in the U.S. Treasury market since late Friday following stronger-than-expected U.S. retail sales data.  \par \par \uc2 Thai financial markets were closed Monday for a public holiday.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar ended at THB37.46, up from THB37.36 at the Asian close Friday, after moving in a range of THB37.36-THB37.46.  \par \par \uc2 'The dollar shot up on news that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had entered the market. However, the verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  couldn't spur a sharp rally as some offshore parties unloaded dollars in the afternoon,' said a dealer at a local bank.  \par \par \uc2 Bank of Thailand Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula said Tuesday the baht was too strong and that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had stepped in during the day to curb the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise.  \par \par \uc2 'The baht is slightly too strong. We will ensure that it weakens slightly, but we will not oppose the baht's market trend,' Pridiyathorn said.  \par \par \uc2 The governor said there were hefty equity-related inflows Friday, which were partially responsible for the baht's strength.  \par \par \uc2 Traders expect the dollar's immediate resistance at THB37.50 to cap the upside in the short term while support is pegged around THB37.35, where the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to take action to limit the baht's rise.  \par \par \uc2 The baht has been outperforming regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  so far this year with a rise of about 11%. JPMorgan said in a report Monday, however, that although Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to limit the baht's gains, it is unlikely to try to reverse those gains because the strength of the baht helps weaken the passthrough to local inflation from higher global oil prices.  \par \par \uc2 -0-   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020060815e28f0053d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
