\par\par \b \uc2 Thai baht at strongest since early 2000  \b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 2006\par 03:38\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE, Aug 11 (Reuters) - The Thai baht rose to its highest level against the dollar since early 2000 on Friday and dealers said they were watching for \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt its rise.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said general strength in Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , expectations of a faster appreciation in the Chinese yuan <CNY=CFXS> and flows into the local stock market all bolstered the baht.  \par \par \uc2 It went as high as 37.35 to the U.S. dollar <THB=>, its highest since February 2000, according to Reuters data.  \par \par \uc2 It is Asia's best performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year with a gain of almost 10 percent.  \par \par \uc2 "The Thai baht is higher, partly because of the regional trend, partly because of the yuan," said a Bangkok trader.  \par \par \uc2 He said the market was wary of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cap the baht's gains but that there had been no sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  activity in early trade.  \par \par \uc2 The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow the baht's rise against the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 Some analysts said that a comment by Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula that the baht was unlikely to return to levels of 38 to 39 per dollar suggested the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would tolerate \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strength to a certain degree.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is closely watching the market but it can't go against the trend," the trader said. "It just doesn't want to see volatile moves."  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-THAILAND-BAHT|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SI|ABX|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060811e28b0003f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
