\par\par \b \uc2 Thai baht capped by suspected c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 313 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 2005\par 06:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE, Oct 21 (Reuters) - The Thai baht was little moved against the dollar on Friday and underperformed most other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with dealers saying they suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to cap \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gains.  \par \par \uc2 One trader in Bangkok said the Bank of Thailand was worried about a further strengthening in the baht, especially with the yen <JPY=> bouncing back from this week's two-year low against the dollar and dragging other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  with it.  \par \par \uc2 "They may have come in this morning at around 40.85 as the yen rebounded against the dollar," said the trader.  \par \par \uc2 By 0425 GMT, the baht <THB=> stood at about 40.87 against the dollar, little changed from levels seen in late Asia trade on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers in Bangkok said they suspected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was buying dollars for baht to prevent the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from breaking through the 40.80 key chart resistance level.  \par \par \uc2 A move through this level is expected to lead to a rapid strengthening in the baht to 40.50 against the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 Aggressive monetary tightening by the Bank of Thailand has boosted the baht, but analysts say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not want to see too strong a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as this would hurt exporter competitiveness.  \par \par \uc2 The baht has strengthened about three percent from two-year lows hit against the dollar in July at about 42.20.  \par \par \uc2 Bank of Thailand Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula said on Thursday the baht was trading at a normal level after its "excessive strength" in the past few weeks.  \par \par \uc2 "Other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are losing ground, so the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not want the baht to strengthen too much," said Irene Cheung, head of Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy at ABN AMRO in Singapore.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 -BAHT|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051021e1al00071\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
