\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Thai Baht Ends Dn, Off 9-Mo Low; Short Bonds Dn Sharply  \b0\par\par\uc2 308 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juli 2005\par 13:23\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2005, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--The Thai baht ended weaker after hitting a nine-month low against the U.S. dollar in Asian spot trade Tuesday, tracking the losses of regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against a surging dollar, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 Government bond prices drifted lower ahead of the start of a new series of weekly auctions on Wednesday, while prices of short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bonds fell sharply ahead of an increase in short-term interest rates expected later in the month.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar finished at THB41.55, up from THB41.43 at the Asian close Monday, and just off a nine-month high of THB41.57.  \par \par \uc2 Expectations that the U.S. will continue raising interest rates for now, especially if U.S. payrolls data come out as strongly as expected Friday, supported the dollar against most global \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Payrolls are expected to show a rise of 200,000 in June, much more than the 75,000 increase reported in May.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar was also helped higher against the Japanese yen, a regional trendsetter, as Prime Minister Junichiro Koizumi won only a thin five-vote majority in a key vote on postal system reform. The vote cast doubts on his government's ability to push through further reforms.  \par \par \uc2 There was little fresh local news moving the baht, but sentiment has been hurt by a string of current-account deficits in the three months to May.  \par \par \uc2 One trader said it was unlikely that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Tuesday, as the baht's move wasn't so great and it was in line with regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Traders expected the dollar to trade in a range of THB41.45 to THB41.60 overnight, subject to any further volatility in the dollar-yen exchange rate.  \par \par \uc2 -0-  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020050705e175006k5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
