\par\par \b \uc2 Thai Ctrl Bk Chief: No  \highlight22\uc2 FX Intervention \highlight\uc2  For Many Weeks  \b0\par\par\uc2 215 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Mai 2005\par 08:47\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula said Thursday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to weaken the baht for many weeks, and that recent baht weakness is mainly due to the broad dollar strength.  \par \par \uc2 "If we compare the baht to the yen or euro, we still strengthen," he told reporters. [ 19-05-05 0705GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Pridiyathorn said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to monitor the market closely, act to stabilize the baht if necessary, facilitate trading transactions and try to prevent any speculation amid the changing environment in the Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is prepared for movements in the yuan should China revalue its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he said.  \par \par \uc2 "Don't worry. We already have plans for yuan movements. Whenever it moves, we will try to smooth things out, reducing the effect to trading transactions."  \par \par \uc2 He added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't foresee any dollar crisis in the future but that it is prepared for any such event. The Thai economy is supported by strong domestic consumption, and could survive any dollar crisis, he said.  \par \par \uc2 -By Bangkok Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744; djnews.bangkok@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Hilary Mc Cully [ 19-05-05 0804GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050519e15j000ad\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
